        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಖರವಾಗಿ (nikharavāgi) is nikhara, \"exact, precise\", with the adverb ending -āgi. The origin of nikhara is uncertain. It may be a northern word: CDIAL 7095 has Hindi nikharnā, \"to become clear\"."
            }
          ]
        },
